# Demo-to-Deck Environment Configuration
# All LLM providers are optional; by default Demo-to-Deck runs locally & deterministically.

# Option 1: Google Gemini (Recommended for fast, high-quality generation)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-flash

# Option 2: OpenAI / OpenAI-Compatible (Groq, Ollama, DeepSeek, Together)
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# Option 3: Anthropic Claude
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022
